{"id":"vod_bf_14506","vodId":"14506","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"灰色的乐园","name_cn":"灰色的乐园","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/57fe42d05a1765a75ccdea3933570968.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为三嶋崎的海边小镇之上，私立美滨学园中，来了一位名叫风见雄二（樱井孝宏 配音）的转学生，然而，让雄二没有想到的是，在学园之中只有五名学生，并且全部都是女性，就这样，在小小的高墙之中，雄二的新生活就此展开。　　拥有美丽外表但性格孤僻的大小姐榊由美子（田中凉子 配 音）、个性开朗活泼，稍稍有些男孩子气的周防天音（田口宏子 配音）、倔强傲娇运气极差的松岛满（水桥香织 配音）、外表天真可爱实则有着悲惨过去的入巢莳菜（民安智惠 配音）和尽忠职守的天然呆小岭幸（清水爱 配音），五个表面看来天真烂漫的女孩，各自却有着灰暗的过去，雄二的到来能否扫清她们心中的阴霾？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 21:37:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/huisedeleyuan/第10集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:23.308Z"}